# An Explorer's Footsteps (otherAreas 19): the edges. Bob, level 9: Abelard: no section: 1130 (the default). Main, level
# 10: 40, option 99 and 101: nothing; option 100 with a full inventory: the clay not given: nothing (not begun). With
# room: begun. A monument while available (bob): no section: the clay kept. The monument (main): a clay and a feather:
# nil (exact); one clay: a tablet (two clays cannot be held: the clay is rare). Abelard: the tablet and a feather: nil
# (exact). The bitmask 0x1FFFF and count 16 (GMs) with a West Ronfaure tablet: bit 0 set: 45 (the count is not reached:
# the bit test comes first). The bitmask 0x1FFFE (GM): bit 0 clear: count 17: 47, finished: 800 gil, the bitmask and
# count 0, the map, completed. Completed: 48 (replaceDefault). Available again (a GM): the bitmask -1 (a GM, not 0): 42,
# option 0: nothing; the bitmask 0x1FFFF (a GM): 42, option 100: a clay; every bit set: TargetMonument unchanged (5, a
# GM before); begun: 43 (5). The clay pressed at West Ronfaure; the bitmask 0x1FFFE and count 17 (GMs): bit 0 clear:
# count 18 (not 17), requested 5: 46, finished: 800 gil. The count's other side (16th tablet: 41) is #all_monuments'
# sixteenth credit.
lists Selbina/Abelard/onTrigger Selbina/Abelard/onTrade Selbina/onEventFinish/40 Selbina/onEventFinish/42 Selbina/onEventFinish/45 Selbina/onEventFinish/47 WestRonfaure/Stone_Monument/onTrade
char zone=Selbina pos=-50.6,-11.3,-13.1 job=WAR lvl=10
char bob zone=Selbina pos=-50.6,-11.3,-11.6 job=WAR lvl=9
item ChocoboFeather
bob: item LumpOfSelbinaClay
login
bob: login
bob: trigger Abelard                    # level 9: no section: 1130
bob: finish
trigger Abelard                         # level 10: 40
finish option=99                        # nothing
trigger Abelard                         # 40
finish option=101                       # nothing
fill-inventory
trigger Abelard                         # 40
finish option=100                       # no room: the clay not given; not begun
free-inventory
trigger Abelard                         # 40
finish option=100                       # a clay; begun
warp -182.2,-12.7,-395.7 WestRonfaure
bob: warp -182.2,-12.7,-394.2 WestRonfaure
bob: trade Stone_Monument LumpOfSelbinaClay x1 # bob available: no section; nothing (the clay kept)
trade Stone_Monument LumpOfSelbinaClay x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # not exact: nil
trade Stone_Monument LumpOfSelbinaClay x1 # a tablet; TabletZoneId 100
warp -50.6,-11.3,-13.1 Selbina
trade Abelard ClayTablet x1 ChocoboFeather x1 # not exact: nil; nothing
charvar [EF]MonumentBitmask 131071      # a GM: 0x1FFFF
charvar [EF]MonumentCount 16            # a GM
trade Abelard ClayTablet x1             # bit 0 set: 45 (the count not read)
finish                                  # a clay; the tablet taken
warp -182.2,-12.7,-395.7 WestRonfaure
trade Stone_Monument LumpOfSelbinaClay x1 # a tablet (100)
warp -50.6,-11.3,-13.1 Selbina
charvar [EF]MonumentBitmask 131070      # a GM: 0x1FFFE
trade Abelard ClayTablet x1             # bit 0 clear: bitmask 0x1FFFF, count 17: 47
finish                                  # 800 gil; the bitmask and count 0; the map; completed
trigger Abelard                         # completed: 48 (replaceDefault)
finish
quest OtherAreas.AnExplorersFootsteps available # a GM
charvar [EF]MonumentBitmask -1          # a GM
trigger Abelard                         # the bitmask -1 (not 0): 42
finish option=0                         # nothing
charvar [EF]MonumentBitmask 131071      # a GM: every bit
charvar Quest[4][19][EF]TargetMonument 5 # a GM
trigger Abelard                         # the bitmask set: 42
finish option=100                       # a clay; every bit set: TargetMonument kept (5); begun
trigger Abelard                         # 43 (5)
finish
warp -182.2,-12.7,-395.7 WestRonfaure
trade Stone_Monument LumpOfSelbinaClay x1 # a tablet (100)
warp -50.6,-11.3,-13.1 Selbina
charvar [EF]MonumentBitmask 131070      # a GM: bit 0 clear
charvar [EF]MonumentCount 17            # a GM
trade Abelard ClayTablet x1             # bit 0 clear: count 18 (not 17); requested 5: 46
finish option=0                         # the tablet taken; 800 gil
